{"v":4,"catch":"一種新型射擊遊戲，具有8種爆炸性超級物品，稱為GUNBALL POWER！","desc":"“Gemini Wing”是TECMO在1987年發布的射擊遊戲。\n在一項秘密任務“Gemini Wing”中，您的目標是控制武裝直升機並從昆蟲中奪回世界。\n通過使用8種不同類型的GUNBALLS擊落敵人來完成階段。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2020-09-10","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6dd73244b7585f9d6cf798ea5fc9315264b407c76fb2d8b09d5902665598c7c1.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3072030d2d6efa62ff68e93223bb1570966cd0f3e8c899c45faf819a4416cd7c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ca28d023fbfe33889f682e71c9504e166d9f99c25e808572f8dcf1c494ba45f9.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3f6a266f61199138b911756109d38604aa765e69b99ee8aa8016ae1176329099.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2d9be22aba48d2b2d7ea5607ede8e0488597f9b7528e434874eeaaca955eebb1.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6cb1fd722ede5b2fe1ef9fd03dad49d375c2dc87d2c3d4154851f3296e0d1c63.jpg"],"titleId":"0100938012a2e000","dlc":[]}